  assertion r.salaried_element = 0.0
  assertion r.additional_payable = 0.0
  assertion r.night_premium = 0.0
  assertion r.total_rate = 0.0
  assertion r.accrues_toil = true
```

## C5_1_Grade5Beyond48

C-5.1 defeats C-4.2 as well as C-4.1, being an exception to C-4 as a whole.

