      -- grade: 5
      -- is_public_holiday: false
      -- is_critical_incident: false
      -- is_night: true
      -- has_standing_shift_allowance: false
    }
  assertion r.multiplier = 0.0
  assertion r.salaried_element = 0.0
  assertion r.additional_payable = 0.0
  assertion r.night_premium = 0.15
  assertion r.total_rate = 0.15
  assertion r.accrues_toil = true
```

## C6_2_StandingAllowance

C-6.2 disapplies the night premium where a standing shift allowance is paid.

```catala
