## Weekly_G3_50Hours

Fifty hours at Grade 3. Eight hours fall under C-4.1 at 1.25 and two under C-4.2 at 1.5. The ordinal is derived from each hour's position in the week, so a timesheet numbered within each day gives the same answer; see tests/counterexamples/CE-0003.yaml.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestWeekly_G3_50Hours:
  output r content Overtime.WeeklyOvertime

scope TestWeekly_G3_50Hours:
  definition r equals
    output of Overtime.WeeklyOvertime with {
      -- hours: [
      Overtime.HourWorked { -- hour_of_week: 1 -- is_public_holiday: false -- is_critical_incident: false -- is_night: false };
      Overtime.HourWorked { -- hour_of_week: 2 -- is_public_holiday: false -- is_critical_incident: false -- is_night: false };
      Overtime.HourWorked { -- hour_of_week: 3 -- is_public_holiday: false -- is_critical_incident: false -- is_night: false };
