## Weekly_EmptyWeek

A week with no hours recorded. No clause of Annex C confers anything, so the
figures are nil rather than an error.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestWeekly_EmptyWeek:
  output r content Overtime.WeeklyOvertime

scope TestWeekly_EmptyWeek:
  definition r equals
    output of Overtime.WeeklyOvertime with {
      -- hours: []
      -- base_hourly_rate: $30.00
      -- grade: 3
      -- has_standing_shift_allowance: false
    }
  assertion r.hours_worked = 0
  assertion r.overtime_payment = $0.00
  assertion r.toil_hours = 0.0
```
